Negative pairs: generation depends on precursor m/z windows and
theoretical-fragment overlap (metadata.generate_pairs_negative),
which is expensive to run here. To materialize them for the
peptide-level split, write the split parquets (--write-split) and run:
    from metadata import metadata
    metadata.generate_pairs_negative(<split>.parquet, config.CHARGES,
        config.PAIR_MZ_TOLERANCE,
        config.NEGATIVE_PAIR_FRAGMENT_TOLERANCE,
        config.NEGATIVE_PAIR_MATCHING_FRAGMENTS_THRESHOLD)

